---
import type { SocialId } from "../lib/site";

/*
 * Brand marks from Simple Icons (CC0). LinkedIn left Simple Icons in v14;
 * its path comes from simple-icons@13.21.0. The AI tools' marks (Claude,
 * Cursor, Google Gemini, Kimi; for the AI usage page) and the Tech Stack's
 * (Swift, fastlane, Bitrise, ReactiveX, LottieFiles, Subversion) and the
 * Apple mark beside "iOS" on Experiences and the Evernote mark on note
 * cards come from simple-icons@16.34.0. Marks under attribution licences there (CocoaPods
 * CC BY-NC, Git CC BY) aren't carried; those pills show an initial. UI icons (stroke style) join in Phase 2.
 * The TL;DR menu's assistants: OpenAI (ChatGPT) left Simple Icons after v13,
 * so like LinkedIn its path is simple-icons@13.21.0's; Grok was never in
 * Simple Icons and comes from @lobehub/icons-static-svg@1.95.1 (MIT), drawn
 * with the even-odd fill rule its path needs.
 */
